sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend
    participant Gemini as Gemini API
    participant Firestore
    participant GCS as Cloud Storage
    participant CloudBuild as Cloud Build
    participant CloudRun as Cloud Run

    User->>Frontend: Enter prompt & click "Generate"
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/services/generate
    activate Backend

    Backend->>Firestore: Create Service Metadata (PENDING)
    Backend->>Backend: Start Background Task
    Backend-->>Frontend: 202 Accepted (Service Metadata)
    deactivate Backend

    par Background Generation Pipeline
        Backend->>Gemini: Generate JSON Spec
        Gemini-->>Backend: JSON Spec
        Backend->>Backend: Validate Spec (Pydantic)
        Backend->>Backend: Generate Flask Code (Jinja2)
        Backend->>GCS: Upload Source Zip
        Backend->>CloudBuild: Trigger Build
        CloudBuild-->>Backend: Build ID
        Backend->>Firestore: Update Status (BUILDING)
    and Cloud Build Process
        CloudBuild->>GCS: Fetch Source
        CloudBuild->>CloudBuild: Build Docker Image
        CloudBuild->>CloudRun: Deploy Service
    and Status Polling
        loop Every X seconds
            Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/v1/services/
            activate Backend
            Backend->>Firestore: Fetch Services
            Backend->>CloudBuild: Check Build Status

            alt Build Success
                Backend->>CloudRun: Get Service URL
                Backend->>Firestore: Update Status (DEPLOYED) & URL
            else Build Failed
                Backend->>Firestore: Update Status (FAILED)
            end

            Backend-->>Frontend: List of Services (with status)
            deactivate Backend
        end
    end

    Frontend->>User: Display "Deployed" & Live URL
